@startuml
!include _theme.puml
title Packagepack Composition
top to bottom direction

package "Selected Stack" {
  rectangle "Enginepack Selection" as Enginepack
  rectangle "Gamepack Selection" as Gamepack
  rectangle "Modpack Selection" as Modpacks
}

rectangle "Visible Choice Resolution" as Choices
rectangle "Packagepack Record" as Save

Enginepack --> Choices : contributes engine option to
Gamepack --> Choices : contributes game option to
Modpacks --> Choices : contributes mod options to
Choices --> Save : writes selected stack into
@enduml
